## Installation

{%- if use_uv %}

```bash
uv sync --group dev
```

Commit the generated `uv.lock` before pushing: CI checks that it matches
`pyproject.toml` and installs the locked dependencies.
{%- else %}

```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv/Scripts/activate   # Windows
source .venv/bin/activate  # Linux and macOS
python -m pip install --upgrade "pip>=25.1"
python -m pip install -e . --group dev
```
{%- endif %}

